# Deny by default: only the allowlisted project inputs below enter the build
# context. Owner secrets (.env), prototypes/, design/, workspaces
# (.devrites/), caches, the host-only runner, its smoke check, the preserved
# predecessor runner and its test driver never do.
*
!go.mod
!go.sum
!.golangci.yml
!deploy/dev/Dockerfile
!deploy/dev/capture-check
!deploy/dev/redact
!deploy/dev/watch.ts
!cmd
!internal
# The shell is built only inside a runner child or a Docker stage, never taken from the host:
# any host build output below internal/server/dist stays out of every image except the
# tracked placeholder that lets `go build` embed the directory.
internal/server/dist/*
!internal/server/dist/.keep
!bench
!testdata
!docs/spikes/*.md
!docs/spikes/data/bench-*/samples/samples.jsonl
!docs/spikes/data/bench-*/before.json
!docs/spikes/data/bench-*/during.json
!docs/spikes/data/bench-*/after.json
!scripts/*.sh
scripts/dev-run.sh
scripts/dev-run-smoke.sh
scripts/dev-run-hardening.sh
scripts/dev-run-test.sh
!web
web/node_modules
web/.svelte-kit
web/build
web/test-results
# Final rules: re-exclude at every depth below every admitted root, so a broad
# `!root` re-inclusion above never admits nested owner files or caches.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/.npmrc
**/.netrc
**/.git
**/.devrites
**/node_modules
**/.svelte-kit
**/.cache
